{"case_id": "C11", "scenario": "Birthday and festive greetings", "case_date": "2026-12-24", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl009"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-09-20", "role": "client", "text": "下周我去看外孙女，那只海军蓝的 Odette 装书正好。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-09-20", "role": "advisor", "text": "顾老师，路上辛苦。Odette 装书确实合适，您用着顺手就好。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-10-30", "role": "client", "text": "回上海了。今年冬天打算在家多读读书，少出门。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-10-30", "role": "advisor", "text": "好的顾老师，天冷了注意保暖。"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-10-30", "role": "client", "text": "谢谢，你也是。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": [], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C12", "scenario": "Birthday and festive greetings", "case_date": "2026-12-03", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl008"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "advisor", "text": "许小姐，您好，我是今天在澄园店接待您的 LACAZE 顾问，之后有问题可以直接在这里找我。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "client", "text": "好的，谢谢～今天就是随便逛逛，Colette 那个象牙白挺好看的。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": [], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C13", "scenario": "Birthday and festive greetings", "case_date": "2026-12-28", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl007"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-30", "role": "client", "text": "年底公司事情多，元旦想带家里人去三亚待几天。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-30", "role": "advisor", "text": "沈先生辛苦了，提前祝您和家人假期愉快。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-30", "role": "client", "text": "谢谢。太太说上次你帮她挑的那只酒红 Colette 她很喜欢。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-30", "role": "advisor", "text": "太好了，替我谢谢沈太太。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": [], "event_id": null}}
