{"case_id": "C15", "scenario": "Birthday and festive greetings", "case_date": "2026-11-20", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl006"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-02-08", "role": "advisor", "text": "周先生，Colette 已经包好了，祝您和太太情人节愉快。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-02-08", "role": "client", "text": "谢谢，她应该会喜欢。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-02-16", "role": "client", "text": "太太很喜欢，过年回家一直背着。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-02-16", "role": "advisor", "text": "太好了，有需要随时找我。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": [], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C16", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-18", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl006"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "client", "text": "你好，太太下个月过生日，想再给她挑一只包，预算 4 万左右。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "advisor", "text": "周先生您好，好的。太太平时什么场合用得多一些？"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "client", "text": "上班通勤吧，她嫌现在那只小，装不下东西。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-11", "role": "client", "text": "颜色最好黑色，耐脏。"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-11-17", "role": "client", "text": "刚才问了下她闺蜜，说她其实更喜欢浅一点的颜色，黑色就算了。"}, {"message_id": "m006", "date": "2026-11-17", "role": "advisor", "text": "明白，那我按浅色、通勤能装的方向给您整理。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["colette", "sable"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C17", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-12", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl005"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-05", "role": "client", "text": "那只黑色 Odette 我天天背，最近出差变多，想再要一只出差用的。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-05", "role": "advisor", "text": "陈先生，出差的话您一般带哪些东西？"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-05", "role": "client", "text": "16 寸的电脑、充电器、一两套文件，有时候放一件换洗衬衫。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-06", "role": "client", "text": "你们那只 Odette 能放 16 寸电脑吗？我现在用的是 13 寸。"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-11-06", "role": "advisor", "text": "我确认一下尺寸再回复您。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["odette"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C18", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-09", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl008"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "advisor", "text": "许小姐，您好，我是今天在澄园店接待您的 LACAZE 顾问，之后有问题可以直接在这里找我。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "client", "text": "好的，谢谢～今天就是随便逛逛，Colette 那个象牙白挺好看的。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-08", "role": "client", "text": "想买第一只你们家的包，但还没想好要什么样的，平时出门东西不多。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-08", "role": "advisor", "text": "许小姐，平时出门一般会带哪些东西？"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-11-08", "role": "client", "text": "手机、钥匙、一个小卡包吧，偶尔带个充电宝。"}, {"message_id": "m006", "date": "2026-11-09", "role": "client", "text": "对了，第一次买有折扣吗？"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["colette", "sable"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C19", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-15", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl010"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-14", "role": "client", "text": "Hi，最近周末 brunch 比较多，想要一只 not too big 的包，可以斜挎的那种。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-14", "role": "advisor", "text": "Emily 您好，周末出门一般带哪些东西呢？"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-14", "role": "client", "text": "phone、卡包、口红，最多再加个 AirPods。上次买的黑色 Colette 我很喜欢，想看看有没有别的颜色。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-15", "role": "client", "text": "酒红会不会太 dressy？"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["colette"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C20", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-26", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl007"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-24", "role": "client", "text": "女儿明年六月硕士毕业，想送她一只 Héritage，现在开始准备来得及吗？"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-24", "role": "advisor", "text": "沈先生，恭喜。您是想选现有款式，还是做定制？"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-24", "role": "client", "text": "定制吧，颜色让她自己挑。大概多久能拿到？"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-25", "role": "client", "text": "能不能年后就先给我留一只？"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["heritage"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C21", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-10", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl003"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-09", "role": "client", "text": "最近骑车上班，想找个双肩包，你们有吗？"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-09", "role": "advisor", "text": "何女士，我看一下再回复您。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "client", "text": "要能放电脑，最好防水一点。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": [], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C22", "scenario": "Product recommendation", "case_date": "2026-11-16", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl001"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-14", "role": "client", "text": "朋友背了一只 Véronique，自然色那个，好好看。我能买吗？"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-14", "role": "advisor", "text": "吴女士，Véronique 确实很受欢迎，我先了解一下情况。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-15", "role": "client", "text": "价格多少？我可以直接付全款。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["veronique"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C23", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-24", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl007"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2025-11-22", "role": "advisor", "text": "沈先生，定制的 Héritage 今天交给您了，谢谢您这段时间的耐心。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2025-11-22", "role": "client", "text": "不错，等了这么久值得。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-06-10", "role": "client", "text": "那只 Héritage 我出差用得多，提手那里有一点点印子，正常吗？"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-06-10", "role": "advisor", "text": "沈先生，方便拍张照片给我看看吗？"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-06-10", "role": "client", "text": "算了，问题不大，我就是问问。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["heritage"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C24", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-11", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl010"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-06-27", "role": "advisor", "text": "Emily，驼色 Sablé 已经包好啦，用着有任何问题随时找我。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-06-27", "role": "client", "text": "Thanks！"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "client", "text": "Hi，我那只 Sablé 的肩带靠近扣环那里有点开线，is it normal？才买了不到半年。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "client", "text": "[图片]"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-11-11", "role": "client", "text": "这个可以修吗？要收费吗？"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["sable"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C25", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-13", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl006"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-12", "role": "client", "text": "你好，太太那只象牙白的 Colette 蹭到了一点咖啡，有没有什么办法能弄掉？"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-12", "role": "advisor", "text": "周先生，蹭到多久了？面积大吗？"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-12", "role": "client", "text": "昨天的事，指甲盖那么大。她不敢自己擦，让我来问问。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["colette"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C26", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-19", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl005"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-18", "role": "client", "text": "那只 Odette 底部的护底钉掉漆了，才用了一年多。这么贵的包，就这个质量？"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-18", "role": "advisor", "text": "陈先生，非常抱歉给您带来不好的体验，方便拍张照片给我吗？"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-18", "role": "client", "text": "[图片]"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-11-19", "role": "client", "text": "你们打算怎么处理？我不想跑来跑去。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["odette"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C27", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-17", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl009"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-16", "role": "client", "text": "女儿托朋友在国外代购了一只黑色 Sablé，想拿到你们店里做一下护理，再印个名字缩写，可以吗？"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-16", "role": "advisor", "text": "顾老师，我先帮您看一下。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-11-17", "role": "client", "text": "她下周回上海，可以直接拿过去。"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["sable"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C28", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-21", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl002"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-08-14", "role": "client", "text": "今天把 Sablé 带回来了，明天上班就背它。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-08-14", "role": "advisor", "text": "林女士，用几天看看合不合习惯。"}, {"message_id": "m003", "date": "2026-08-20", "role": "client", "text": "挺好的，轻。"}, {"message_id": "m004", "date": "2026-09-02", "role": "client", "text": "中秋要回老家，你们中秋有什么活动吗？"}, {"message_id": "m005", "date": "2026-09-02", "role": "advisor", "text": "林女士，中秋这边暂时没有活动安排，有的话我第一时间告诉您。"}, {"message_id": "m006", "date": "2026-09-02", "role": "client", "text": "好的。"}, {"message_id": "m007", "date": "2026-09-28", "role": "client", "text": "回来了，给你带了点老家的月饼，下次去店里给你。"}, {"message_id": "m008", "date": "2026-09-28", "role": "advisor", "text": "太客气了，谢谢林女士。"}, {"message_id": "m009", "date": "2026-10-15", "role": "client", "text": "最近开会多，想看一只正式一点的包。"}, {"message_id": "m010", "date": "2026-10-15", "role": "advisor", "text": "好的，我整理几款发您。"}, {"message_id": "m011", "date": "2026-10-16", "role": "advisor", "text": "林女士，Odette 和 Margaux 的介绍已经发您，您有空看看。"}, {"message_id": "m012", "date": "2026-10-18", "role": "client", "text": "看了，Odette 方向可以，先不急。"}, {"message_id": "m013", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "client", "text": "你们那个年度护理是免费的吗？"}, {"message_id": "m014", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "advisor", "text": "是的，官方门店购买的手袋每年可以送店做一次免费基础护理。"}, {"message_id": "m015", "date": "2026-10-25", "role": "client", "text": "那 Sablé 明年再送吧，还新。"}, {"message_id": "m016", "date": "2026-11-02", "role": "client", "text": "对了，我那只黑色 Colette 是不是去年买的？"}, {"message_id": "m017", "date": "2026-11-02", "role": "advisor", "text": "是的，去年 12 月。"}, {"message_id": "m018", "date": "2026-11-02", "role": "client", "text": "好久没背了，基本都是年会才用。"}, {"message_id": "m019", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "client", "text": "下周出差，又用不上它了哈哈。"}, {"message_id": "m020", "date": "2026-11-10", "role": "advisor", "text": "出差顺利。"}, {"message_id": "m021", "date": "2026-11-20", "role": "client", "text": "今年年会取消了，那只 Colette 估计要放到明年了。"}, {"message_id": "m022", "date": "2026-11-21", "role": "client", "text": "长时间不背的话，要怎么放比较好？会不会变形？"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["colette"], "event_id": null}}
{"case_id": "C29", "scenario": "Post-purchase care", "case_date": "2026-11-08", "client_information": {"client_id": "cl004"}, "conversation_history": [{"message_id": "m001", "date": "2026-11-07", "role": "advisor", "text": "张女士，天开始干了，Véronique 不用的时候放进防尘袋里，避开暖气旁边就好。"}, {"message_id": "m002", "date": "2026-11-08", "role": "client", "text": "嗯"}], "product_information": {"product_ids": ["veronique"], "event_id": null}}
